P4_Sight / ESP32-P4_IMX708
Mixed-license source distribution

This repository is not licensed as a single work under one repository-wide
license. The license applicable to a file is determined in this order:

1. A file-level SPDX identifier or license notice controls that file.
2. Otherwise, the nearest license file in the directory tree controls.
3. Otherwise, project-authored material is licensed under Apache-2.0.

Project-authored application source, the iOS receiver and project documentation
are available under Apache-2.0 unless a more specific notice applies. The full
Apache-2.0 text is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

The active IMX708 register-definition and register-sequence files listed below
contain material derived in substantial part from the Raspberry Pi Linux IMX708
driver and are distributed under GPL-2.0-only:

- GATA_P4_ESP_VIDEO/components/esp-video-components/esp_cam_sensor/
  sensors/imx708/private_include/imx708_regs.h
- GATA_P4_ESP_VIDEO/components/esp-video-components/esp_cam_sensor/
  sensors/imx708/private_include/imx708_settings.h

Other vendored and reference files retain their original Espressif, Apache,
GPL, BSD or Linux UAPI terms. See LICENSES/README.md and
docs/THIRD_PARTY.md for the complete path-specific map.

No prebuilt firmware binary is distributed here. A firmware image built from
this source includes material under more than one license and is not covered by
Apache-2.0 alone. This repository does not represent that every component can
be redistributed together under one permissive license. Redistributors are
responsible for satisfying every applicable license.
